+			// woocommerce_remote_variant_assignment is a sticky random 1-120 bucket used to roll
+			// features and plugin upsells out to a percentage of stores. class-woocommerce.php
+			// forces it to 0 so this store sits below every server-side 'range' rule, which are
+			// all bounded at both ends ( >= min && <= max ).
